                    {
                        "sense_id": "525e7baf-c749-3427-8a7a-7ef9e6f008c3",
                        "entry_id": "7a1bf252-81ef-3b37-810b-469910215829",
                        "glosses": [
                            "mulled wine"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5172addc-b390-4b80-bd1f-43fa803734a5",
                                "sense_id": "525e7baf-c749-3427-8a7a-7ef9e6f008c3",
                                "text": "Его́р Ива́ныч принялся́ за глинтве́йн и, пока́ около́точный допива́л свой стака́н, успе́л рассказа́ть ему́ о́чень мно́го интере́сного.",
                                "translation": "Yegor Ivanitch attacked the mulled wine, and before the policeman had finished his glass succeeded in telling him a great many interesting things.",
                                "english": "Yegor Ivanitch attacked the mulled wine, and before the policeman had finished his glass succeeded in telling him a great many interesting things."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
